Begin parent resource.
Use resource name Queue.
Use table queues.
Use path "/queues".
Field name is required str and is unique.
Begin query.
Use no exact filter.
Use no date filter.
Limit query results to 100.
End query.
End parent resource.
Begin child resource.
Use resource name Task.
Use table tasks.
Use path "/tasks".
Field task_id is required str and is unique.
Field target is required str and is not unique.
