Begin flow register_task.
Input queue_id has type integer.
Input task has type child_input.
Begin steps.
Begin step auth with operation authorize.
On failure, use no undo.
End step auth.
Begin transaction write.
Begin step registered with operation child.create.
Set argument parent_id to input queue_id.
Set argument data to input task.
On failure, undo with delete_created.
End step registered.
End transaction write.
End steps.
Return task_id from step registered field "task_id".
End flow register_task.
End request.
